    "paragraphs": [
      "Music Club VITCC, one of the oldest and most prestigious cultural clubs at VIT Chennai, brings forward the culmination of some of the most talented musicians from around the country.",
      "The excellent musical taste, arduous effort, and dedication of all members inspire the club to organize numerous events, stage productions, and college concerts throughout the year.",
